        "自分の部屋で寝ていた僕は、扉が開く音で目を覚ました。\n柔らかい光がカーテンの隙間から差し込んでいる。\nどうやら……もう朝みたいだ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b00aa8af80ffd5ead54ed3a093d2f288a2a5e0975d9464c631fc96e76e2ff094",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "朝よ、ご主人さま。起きなさい。\n男の子が寝坊助なんて、みっともないわよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "adb6db5620bddf003d4fcfadd10981afdadfeadeab97d432c74fcb491bbe8c4d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아침이야, 주인님. 일어나.\n남자애가 늦잠꾸러기라니, 꼴사나워.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "702421dfdffe964ddfd69119c0a37d5c595dbc1c3afd4f3f5f179350782f3099",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-20261101-10001A0_Nml-r002",
      "review_note": "‘男の子’의 호칭 뉘앙스를 ‘남자애’로 복원하고 에테지아의 단정적인 말끝을 자연스럽게 다듬었다.",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e21399c8e420574f547c5f284c89cb268c751a55c265255b579e0a73c03e1b70:000002_2537124442545043726:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
